<%# locals: (shifts:) %>
<%# The grouping rule, one pair for every page whose card explains it. %>
<dt>What is a mentoring shift?</dt>
<dd>
  The mentees signed in to one <%= shifts.mentee_position&.title || "mentee" %> shift, or within an hour of its
  start, with the mentors signed in around it. Sign-ins that match no shift are grouped with each other by the hour.
</dd>
